         <t:abstract> 
            <t:p>The prayer <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">ʿƎqabanni</t:foreign> exists in two versions. This record
            corresponds to the edition <t:bibl>
                  <t:ptr target="bm:Grebaut1935Eqabani"/>
               </t:bibl>, while <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4663Eqabanni">ʿƎqabanni (longer version)</t:ref> contains an additional
            section which narrates how a nobleman in the city of Franks (<t:foreign xml:lang="gez">ʾafrengi</t:foreign>) received
               the prayer from heaven. The general record to be used in cases where the recension is not known is 
               <t:ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6279EqabanniGen">ʿƎqabanni (general record)</t:ref>.</t:p>
         </t:abstract>
